$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a1-01.wav')
$s.Speak('TRUCK-042 is a refrigerated shipment. Its cargo spoils outside a two to six degree band.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a1-02.wav')
$s.Speak('Two agents observe it, isolated in code. The Vehicle Agent reads only the truck''s sensors; the Environment Agent only route and weather. Neither can see the other.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a1-03.wav')
$s.Speak('Run a check on a normal shipment.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a1-04.wav')
$s.Speak('Both agents dispatched in parallel: five signals from the truck, four from the environment.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a1-05.wav')
$s.Speak('The Trust Gate grades all nine before any model sees them: schema, freshness recomputed from the timestamp, provenance against the one authorised source agent, then one reading per signal.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a1-06.wav')
$s.Speak('Nine trusted, none excluded. The Risk Assessment Engine reasons over that evidence and reports low risk.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a1-07.wav')
$s.Speak('And the deterministic controller decides: auto optimise, one hundred percent confidence. Dispatch continues.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-01.wav')
$s.Speak('Now a realistic failure. The cooling unit reports ON, while cargo climbs to eleven and a half degrees, in forty-one degree heat, after thirty-seven minutes stopped.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-02.wav')
$s.Speak('Both of those cannot be true. Either the cooling unit is not actually running, or the cargo sensor is wrong.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-03.wav')
$s.Speak('Run it.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-04.wav')
$s.Speak('The agents report independently. Neither can see the other''s data, so neither can explain the discrepancy away.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-05.wav')
$s.Speak('Correlation catches it deterministically, before the model reasons at all: cooling on, cargo above the safe maximum.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-06.wav')
$s.Speak('Then the Critic goes looking for inconsistency, and finds it. High risk, contradiction detected, four factors cited.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-07.wav')
$s.Speak('The Verifier then checks the Critic against its own evidence: is high risk backed by factors, does every factor map to a real signal, is the contradiction supported?')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-08.wav')
$s.Speak('Confidence falls from a hundred percent to seventy-eight: nine trusted signals, minus a two signal contradiction penalty, over nine expected. Computed in code — the model is forbidden from reporting confidence at all.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-09.wav')
$s.Speak('Now the deterministic gate. Three states, five rules, first match wins.')
$s.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:\Users\ShivaniKinagi\OneDrive - Trinamix Systems Pvt Ltd\Desktop\project\fleet\demo\build\audio\a2-10.wav')
$s.Speak('Rule four fires: risk high with a contradiction flag. Critical halt. Automated dispatch stops.')
